        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple lives of three young people.<br>A college student, a high schooler, and a working adult—reliving each stage of life once more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 1 hour to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Horror / Exploration Adventure</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Unique Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monochrome visual style with all colors stripped away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal jump scares; emphasis on a supernatural worldview</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror experienced through unsettling sounds and spatial atmosphere</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Behind the Scenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a 20-year-old student.<br>All programming and design self-taught, completed in just one month.<br>Created with zero budget—this is their second work, though unrelated to the first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ <strong>Stream</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allowed (Steam store page link must be included in the video description)</p>",
